Short:        Combines assembly with parts of C. V1.9
Author:       Joe Siebenmann
Uploader:     joes potomac net ( Joe Siebenmann )
Architecture: m68k-amigaos


EZAsm combines 680X0 assembly language with parts of C.
Produces highly optimized code. Supports all 3.x functions,
braces, "else", ".fd" support, and much more.
 
